# Resi idles on the St. Wolfgang quay for 11827 frames, hops onto the
# Dampfer (the scroll starts in step 11933), walks off its stern and rests
# on the lake bed with DOWN held, pushed along the flat bed by the left
# edge through the whole zone (as qa_m5_autoscroll_afk_diver_whole_zone).
# The camera reaches column 208 and hands over to the lead-out in step
# 16200 (11933 + 4267), the same step the timer runs out: she dies
# (TimeUp) on the bed at x 3328 with the camera at 3328 in the lead-out.
# She passed the lantern checkpoint under the pontoon, so she respawns
# there at 16260 (x 1954, camera x 1816) back in the scroll with the
# 60-frame hold.
